{# SoundNet Storefront AI Mode Similar Modal Template #}
<div class="soundnet-modal-backdrop" id="soundnetSimilarModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="soundnetModalTitle">
  <div class="soundnet-modal-dialog">
    <div class="soundnet-modal-header">
      <div class="soundnet-modal-header__brand">
        <svg class="ai-sparkle-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7"></circle>
          <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="15" y2="15"></line>
          <path d="M10 6 L11 8.5 L13.5 9.5 L11 10.5 L10 13 L9 10.5 L6.5 9.5 L9 8.5 Z" fill="#FBBF24" stroke="none"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="soundnet-modal-header__title" id="soundnetModalTitle">AI Mode • Умный подбор похожей музыки</h3>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="soundnet-modal-close" onclick="SoundnetStorefront.closeSimilarModal();" aria-label="Закрыть">✕</button>
    </div>
    <div class="soundnet-modal-subtitle-bar" id="soundnetModalSubtitle">
      Поиск акустических и векторных соответствий...
    </div>
    <div class="soundnet-modal-body" id="soundnetSimilarModalContent">
      <div class="soundnet-modal-loader">
        <div class="soundnet-loader-spinner"></div>
        <p>Анализ акустических характеристик, частотного профиля и векторного каталога...</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
